´*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/09/5396179/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思いながら見てました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回楽しく出来たのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に出演した3人のおかげ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあります(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七海は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっこみ隊長として、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スベりながらも楽しんで貰おうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見近寄りがたそうな雰囲気の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい子達にいじられたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年上組には甘えてくきたりする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても親しみやすい子なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セクシー担当は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂いちゃいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七海も充分セクシーだよ|(￣3￣)|？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怜奈は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人前に出ると発動する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【表れなち】が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ抜け切れてないなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親しくなるとね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと表情も豊かだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話が止まらなくなるの！"},